The story about the bum who finds a black suitcase full of money already turned itself into a city legend. Watch a sleek, indie interpretation of it in John Rambo’s short movie “Bum Luck”.

{% embed provider="youtube" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SWYv90O7_OU" /%}

Starring my friend William Rivera as the main character.

